      "writtenOn": "2023-01-02T01:31:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is not required.  But I figure that whoever created this hatch_fp/board.h looked at nocturne_fp/board.h, and assumed that `CONFIG_FINGERPRINT_MCU` should be copied over, since hatch_fp is also a fingerprint MCU.  They may not have realized that the only effect was to have a mutable spi_devices[], and since this board does not at any point in fact modify the elements of spi_devices[], there it really should from the start not have been mutable.",
